```

Key observation: **`"book"` is in `simpleTypes` and `preOrder`** as a distinct recognized type, but it gets remapped to `"lab"` during resource building (see below).

#### 2c. course-utils.ts -- createWalls()

**File: `D:\code\tutors-apps\cli\tutors-model-lib\src\utils\course-utils.ts`**

```typescript
export function createWalls(course: Course) {
  course.walls = [];
  course.wallMap = new Map<string, Lo[]>();
  ["talk", "note", "lab", "web", "archive", "github"].forEach((type) =>
    addWall(course, type as LoType)
